flowchart TB
    A[1. Your computer<br/>Send task and tool definitions<br/>Keep both API keys here]
    B[2. OpenRouter model<br/>Request a file read, edit,<br/>or test run]
    C[3. Your computer<br/>Validate the requested action]
    D[4. Render working sandbox<br/>Run Python and return output<br/>No host API keys]
    E[5. Your computer<br/>Return results to the model<br/>Repeat steps 2 to 4 as needed]
    F[6. Fresh Render sandbox<br/>Independently test the repair]
    G[7. Snapshot and restore<br/>Continue from saved files<br/>Verify, then clean up]
    A --> B --> C --> D --> E --> F --> G
